{
  "_comment": [
    "Hook wiring for abacus. Every command uses the portable",
    "interpreter idiom `command -v python3 && python3 X || python X` because a",
    "bare `python3` is absent on some Windows installs while `python` is absent",
    "on many Linux ones; a hook that cannot start is indistinguishable from a",
    "plugin that does nothing.",
    "",
    "Timeouts are budgets, not expectations. PreToolUse gets the tightest one",
    "because it is the only blocking hook and sits between the agent and every",
    "edit; SessionEnd gets the loosest because `bd dolt push` talks to a remote.",
    "",
    "Only PreToolUse can influence whether a tool runs. The other six always",
    "exit 0 (see hook_io.guard) — see adr/002."
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "command -v python3 >/dev/null 2>&1 && python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/scripts/session_start.py\" || python \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/scripts/session_start.py\"",
            "timeout": 20
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write|NotebookEdit|MultiEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "command -v python3 >/dev/null 2>&1 && python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/scripts/gate_edits.py\" || python \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/scripts/gate_edits.py\"",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "command -v python3 >/dev/null 2>&1 && python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/scripts/watch_bd_commands.py\" || python \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/scripts/watch_bd_commands.py\"",
            "timeout": 30
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "command -v python3 >/dev/null 2>&1 && python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/scripts/prompt_statusline.py\" || python \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/scripts/prompt_statusline.py\"",
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "command -v python3 >/dev/null 2>&1 && python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/scripts/stop_reconcile.py\" || python \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/scripts/stop_reconcile.py\"",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreCompact": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "command -v python3 >/dev/null 2>&1 && python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/scripts/session_start.py\" --precompact || python \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/scripts/session_start.py\" --precompact",
            "timeout": 10
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "SessionEnd": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "command -v python3 >/dev/null 2>&1 && python3 \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/scripts/session_end.py\" || python \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/hooks/scripts/session_end.py\"",
            "timeout": 60
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
